  "description": "End-to-end alignment pipeline for Oxford Nanopore Technology data. Run Sentieon minimap2 to align input FASTQ files. Link methyl tags and read groups from corresponding unaligned input BAM files. Sort the alignment BAM files by coordinates. Merge the aligned BAM files. Calculate quality metrics. Implemented to run per single sample and library. Build hg38/GRCh38",
